<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-27T00:38:52.461Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:38:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks continue in the southern insurgency zone, with grenade blasts wounding security volunteers in Narathiwar and Yala and a pipe bomb injuring army officers in the same area. Thailand rejected Cambodia's demand for temple artifacts and protested Cambodian road construction in Oddar Meanchey, while Cambodia persisted in its protests over the construction and temple disputes. Thailand is introducing digital border passes at the Mae Sai crossing and has joined Singapore and Malaysia in the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative, and the first phase of a border fence in Chanthaburi has been completed. Malaysia and Thailand began joint maritime patrols to curb crime and held joint meetings to promote bilateral cooperation in border areas. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNX2hzN2tyc05tRklHOGpOdmhMa2xyV3ZadXZVa1liMzh5WkwyT29KWWpiZFZfQ1NaR2FmSUJOREtrQWpzUG50T0pBZ2ptdlJuTGRTeERLbmZvTVBkc1pWR3IzR0U3WnVOOGpVVkJySEdSSXVzMVVOM1A2Q2NtV0ZaN0dpdXcyU0gzUHcxR3Bkd3FJLU5mYWEtOTdXbmt2dlEyRzBQMVlmcWQyNHg4RlFUcUJ0cXBranpMM1A0anJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPMEkySTF3SnEzT0s0d1Z2QzFGdzN3MFZCTHlta1hkX0ZYdVltOU1McXhCQndXZV9rSnlYWDcwTWg4WGI3dlJlbG5vT1RSSzN6Q1NCLXZTWS0yeGswQ3BBeV9CN2JnTVVHQ3VxUU5NZ2wybVlKU0tRR29Ma28wbUs5eEstc3gtSjljbXJDRU9xYU96dkdQa2V2Smd3amk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOeWJvSXp5bFJOc1VESzNvQU9UblFKS3U5ZWYwdGIzdW5fWjg2ZnlwNnduYV9rV1J5eV9mM0JuTXpVei1jVXNSWjFuZE1BQ0FhRy1wbm1RcU1hMDd0aUp6T19iaUJwTGF2Nld3NGhvQnkteThOdDRVS3JsUVlROUVkQWhPZWFaSm0zZW5mTlRlYTREWFlUY21vTzI0QU1Sb1gtVGk2RGw1Y3FYclZXYUhqaUN4TW0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Diplomat – Asia-Pac